  "observationsAndLimits": [
    "Element screenshots for products and mobile FAQ include fixed header and bottom-bar overlays. These are retained unchanged and are not described as obstruction-free screenshots. Full-page evidence, DOM and measured visibility show the complete content, while normal scrolling is required to move text away from fixed bars.",
    "A fixed mobile bottom bar overlays a strip of content in viewport/full captures. It provides58px home and phone controls; full document and footer space remain scrollable. No claim that every text pixel is simultaneously visible.",
    "Keyboard evidence is limited to first Tab/Enter skip-to-main, repeated mobile menu click/Space/Enter, and navigation/back/forward. Comprehensive keyboard-only/assistive-technology audit is not claimed.",
    "External SKU links and tel targets were inspected without placing calls, orders, or opening external product flows. Public and external response validation remains S09 pending."
